  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Sebastian
    Text: Very well, then you can surely work from that in your silly investigation.
      Now let me be. While you play around as some detective,  I will find who truly
      did this.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -6322953688314822395, guid: c9583b64e73bdd1478a84d540701a034, type: 3}
